## Phase 4 Accomplishments: FEFO Allocation, GST Calculation & POS Billing

1. **FEFO (First-Expiry, First-Out) Engine**:
   - [`server/services/fefo.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/services/fefo.ts)
   - Greedily allocates items from earliest-expiring active batches in the selected store.
   - Prevents stock overselling and guarantees strict expiration priority.

2. **GST Calculation Service**:
   - [`server/services/gst.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/services/gst.ts)
   - Computes per-line taxable amount, discount deductions, split CGST/SGST (intrastate) or IGST (interstate), round-off calculation, and net invoice totals.

3. **Backend POS Routes**:
   - [`server/routes/pos.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/pos.ts) mounted in [`server/routes.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes.ts).
   - `GET /inventory/pos/item-search` — High-speed live stock search across batches.
   - `POST /inventory/pos/invoices` — Atomically generates invoice `INV/...`, logs negative `SALE` stock movement per batch, and inserts tax lines.
   - `GET /inventory/pos/invoices` & `GET /inventory/pos/invoices/:id` — Sales invoice query and detail endpoints.
   - `POST /inventory/pos/returns` — Processes sales returns (`RET/...`) and conditionally restocks via `POS_RETURN` movement.

4. **Frontend POS Terminal**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/pos.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/pos.tsx)
   - Marg ERP–inspired workspace featuring keyboard shortcuts (`F2` search, `F9` checkout, `Esc` clear), customer & doctor metadata entry, live item autocomplete dropdown with batch/expiry/rate info, inline qty & discount adjustments, live tax summary, multi-payment mode tender selector (Cash, Card, UPI, Credit), and printable receipt dialog.

5. **Sales Invoices Directory**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/invoices/index.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/invoices/index.tsx)
   - Invoices ledger with customer details, payment badges, net totals, and printable Tax Invoice modal.

6. **Sidebar Navigation Update**:
   - Added links for **POS Billing Terminal** (`/inventory/pos`) and **Sales Invoices** (`/inventory/invoices`) under "Inventory & Store" in [`Shell.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/components/Shell.tsx).

